The '''New Year's Celebration''' is an [[Event]] that takes place '''Late Winter, 29-31''' (in-game time). During this time, the {{NPCSprite|Baker}} appears next to {{NPCSprite|Jerry}} in the {{Zone|Village}}, allowing players to claim one {{Item|New Year Cake}} for the year, or purchase a {{Item|New Year Cake Bag}} for {{Coins|250,000}}. This can hold up to 54 of your New Year Cakes and gives +1 {{Stat|HP}} for every unique Cake stored inside.

